  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mentorproject TYC and VU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a collaboration that exploits the best of both organizations, TYC &amp; VU wants to establish a mentorship programme. The aim of the pilot project is to teach young people, whose lives have been difficult, that they, too, are worthy and capable of becoming part of society. The mentorship program will initially take place in Dar-Es-Salaam in collaboration between the two organizations. Whereas the core activity will therefore be to facilitate mentoring sessions, other activities include developing the mentor guidelines as well as recruiting and educating mentors. The program will strengthen the young people&#xfffd;s capacity to express their needs, ambitions, and hopes for the future.</narrative>
  </description>
